{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/calm_breathing.dart:offset-38007", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/calm_breathing.dart", "location": "offset-38007", "text": "'Breathe however you normally would. Nothing is pacing you and '\n'nothing is being scored.'", "sha256": "d970fe69b35c89d440523f5143ca7357cd085198ca6f92e7f117c3b69a1a6d91", "kind": "dart", "start": 38007, "end": 38112, "line": 995}
